### 4. Server Startup

```mermaid
graph TD
    A["python chat-webui.py"] --> A1["Load configs at module import:\nmodel.json, models.json,\nsys_prompt.txt, users.json"]
    A --> B["load_sessions()\nLoad per-user session files"]
